## Disqualifiers checked (deployment cost counts, independent of accuracy)

- Starts cleanly on the target environment: YES / NO -> <DETAIL>
- New dependencies and their licenses: <LIST_OR_NONE>
- Operational cost delta (install size, boot time, memory, quota):
  <MEASURED_OR_HONESTLY_UNKNOWN>
- A challenger that cannot start is clearly not better; patching the working
  incumbent's runtime to benchmark a challenger is an unacceptable trade.

